  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Agricultural Livelihoods Assistance for Affected Populations in North-East Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activities under this project directly link with the allocation strategy presented to partners by the Nigeria Humanitarian Fund and the prioritization by the Food Security Sector for the Emergency Standard Allocation Strategy. Prioritized activities under this project will directly contribute to the Provision of Agricultural Resilience Support - livelihood inputs/assets or using a multiple-modality and approaches. The targeted locations for Livelihood activities are: Adamawa State - Gombi and Hong LGAs.</narrative>
  </description>
